  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-01-28",
   "text": "Medicare Dental Benefit Act of 2021\n This bill provides for Medicare coverage of dental and oral health services, including routine diagnostic and preventive services, basic and major dental services, and emergency care; dental prostheses are also covered. Currently, such services are excluded from Medicare coverage."
  }
